# Lean product boundaries

- Read the current canonical lean plan and root AGENTS.md. L001-L030 replace C000-C179; historical records are not active instructions.
- Free public comparison plus progressive quiz; no backoffice, staff/quorum, runtime ML or visitor account.
- Owner supplies sources. Preserve provenance/context/candidacy coverage; label automated interpretation and keep unknown/conflicting/unsupported positions unscored.
- No historical substitution or coalition inheritance without applicable evidence.
- Answers/priorities/scope/affinities stay in browser memory. Same public bank for all; same evidence/weights before ordering.
- Ten then optional five; explicit finish before personalized party reveal. Overlap is not probability or a target of 100%.
- Optional fit/policy metrics use independent opt-in randomized limited contributions and counters, never a raw political profile. Actual host/log flow precedes activation; no anonymity/unique-voter guarantee.
- Spanish UI, English original code/docs, optional regional packs with meaning/score parity; no formal fluent-review staffing gate.
- One Laravel host, static bundles, SQLite counters; local import/build, no mandatory worker/Redis/PostgreSQL/model service.
- Validate hashes/pin sessions, support corrections/withdrawal and rollback. PUBLIC-LAUNCH is the sole concrete external-action approval; local engineering proceeds autonomously.
- Exact-staged CI/security checks remain required before each main commit. No hook bypass, automatic push or reset of user work.
